{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20231113\/20231113132921_42765.png","category_id":"6a157626b0cd2e35d86fcf74","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2023-03-29 11:11:26","details":"<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"> <\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">一直以来，赛诺邦格在行业与市场中深耕前行，致力于药物递送系统及医疗器械相关业务，研发、生产和销售高端药物递送载体\/原辅料\/原料药、医用新材料，凭借着高质量的产品、丰富的行业经验得到大家的一致好评。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"> <br \/>\r\n为感谢广大客户的信赖与选择，助力各位科研人员的工作，赛诺邦格特推出“期刊奖励计划”，符合活动要求将有机会获得价值千元礼品。诚邀新老客户参与，与赛诺邦格一同奔赴生物医药领域的星辰大海。<br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><span style=\"color:#1F497D;\"><strong><\/strong><\/span><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><span style=\"color:#1F497D;\"><strong><\/strong><\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"> <\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:18px;\"><strong>一、活动要求<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong>01<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:left;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"color:#505050;font-size:16px;font-family:思源黑体;\">使用赛诺邦格产品并在发表文章中注明“厦门赛诺邦格生物科技股份有限公司”或“XIAMEN SINOPEG BIOTECH CO., LTD.”或“SINOPEG”。<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:left;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"color:#505050;font-size:16px;font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong>02<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">申请领奖人必须为论文第一作者、第二作者或通讯作者。<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong>03<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">每篇文章仅限申请一次，不可重复申请。若一篇文章同时使用到赛诺邦格多个产品，奖励不进行叠加。<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong>04<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">奖励申请按文章见刊时间为准，限2023年1月1日--2023年12月31日期间发表的学术文章。发表期刊分区按照当年中科院公布的数据为准。2023年间见刊文章的奖励申请期限为：即日起至2024年1月15日。<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong>05<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">本活动最终解释权归厦门赛诺邦格生物科技股份有限公司所有。<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<br \/>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"> <\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">二、奖励方案<\/span><\/strong> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<table style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;padding:0px;width:546px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"168\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#476A97;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">发表刊物<\/span><\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"478\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#476A97;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong>奖励方案<\/strong><\/span> \r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"168\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#FEFEFE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">一区文章<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"478\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#FEFEFE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;font-size:16px;\">价值1000元礼品或京东卡<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"168\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#FEFEFE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">二区文章<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"478\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#FEFEFE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">价值500元礼品或京东卡<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"168\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#FEFEFE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;\">其它期刊<\/span><span style=\"color:#505050;font-size:16px;\">（包括中文期刊）<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"478\" style=\"border:1px dashed #476A97;background-color:#FEFEFE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\">价值200元礼品或京东卡<\/span><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"><\/span> \r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t\t\t\t<\/p>\r\n\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"line-height:24px;font-size:16px;color:#1F497D;font-family:思源黑体;\">注：期刊分区按中科院分区。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<br \/>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#222222;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:15px;background-color:#e6eeff;text-indent:2em;text-align:justify;\"=\"\"> <span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;\"> <\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">三、奖励申请<\/span><\/strong> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;font-size:16px;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:思源黑体;font-size:16px;\">申请人需填写好期刊奖励申请表（附表一），并将申请表及论文电子版发送至邮箱：marketing@sinopeg.com，并在邮件主题中注明“院校+姓名+期刊奖励申请”。可添加以下微信咨询：<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20230329\/20230329111716_80639.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"131\" =\"\"=\"\" align=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;\"><span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:16px;\"><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:16px;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:16px;\">经审核通过后，我司会联系申请人并按照奖励方案派发。<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-indent:32px;text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"line-height:24px;font-size:16px;font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#337FE5;\"><strong>期刊奖励申请表（附表一）<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong><\/strong><\/span><br \/>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/file\/20230329\/20230329112539_12805.docx\" target=\"_blank\">https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/file\/20230329\/20230329112539_12805.docx<\/a> \r\n\t<\/p>","intro":"一直以来，赛诺邦格在行业与市场中深耕前行，致力于药物递送系统及医疗器械相关业务，研发、生产和销售高端药物递送载体\/原辅料\/原料药、医用新材料，凭借着高质量的产品、丰富的行业经验得到大家的一致好评。 为感谢广大客户的信赖与选择，助力各位科研人员的工作，赛诺邦格特推出“期刊奖励计划”，符合活动要求将有机会获得价值千元礼品。","label_id":[],"recommend":true,"readnum":0,"sort":113,"status":1,"title":"助力科研 | 赛诺邦格期刊奖励计划","type":"content","webDesc":"一直以来，赛诺邦格在行业与市场中深耕前行，致力于药物递送系统及医疗器械相关业务，研发、生产和销售高端药物递送载体\/原辅料\/原料药、医用新材料，凭借着高质量的产品、丰富的行业经验得到大家的一致好评。 为感谢广大客户的信赖与选择，助力各位科研人员的工作，赛诺邦格特推出“期刊奖励计划”，符合活动要求将有机会获得价值千元礼品。","webKey":"助力科研 | 赛诺邦格期刊奖励计划","webTitle":"助力科研 | 赛诺邦格期刊奖励计划","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","is_top":0,"update_time":"2026-05-28 17:44:12","id":"6a180e6cd86fa039f02699f2","gl_list":[]}